WEBVTT

00:04:27.907 --> 00:04:30.255
Otherwise, how does one explain the fact

00:04:30.279 --> 00:04:33.545
that geography puts the source
of the River Nile in Ethiopia,

00:04:34.572 --> 00:04:37.964
and its people cannot
have water for their lives?

00:04:38.736 --> 00:04:42.617
And the same geography
puts California in the desert,

00:04:42.641 --> 00:04:44.312
but it is a breadbasket.

00:04:45.578 --> 00:04:48.408
The difference, obviously,
is not geography.

00:04:49.413 --> 00:04:50.742
It is knowledge.

00:04:51.686 --> 00:04:53.678
Colorado's aquifers

00:04:53.702 --> 00:04:55.842
grow California's pistachios.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.078
Why can't Libya's aquifers

00:04:59.102 --> 00:05:01.729
grow sorghum in northern Nigeria?